\",\"translations\":[]},\"location\":{\"latitude\":51.5128,\"longitude\":-0.1305},\"contactDetails\":{\"phoneNumbers\":[],\"email\":\"\",\"address\":{\"line1\":\"99 Shaftesbury Avenue,\",\"line2\":\"London,\",\"city\":\"W1D 5DY\"}},\"ianaTimeZoneName\":\"Europe/London\"}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"HO00006097\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"The Phoenician Scheme\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"The story of a family and a family business. Starring: Benicio del Toro as Zsa-zsa Korda, one of the richest men in Europe; Mia Threapleton as Liesl, his daughter/a nun; Michael Cera as Bjorn, their tutor. With: Riz Ahmed, Tom Hanks, Bryan Cranston, Mathieu Amalric, Richard Ayoade, Jeffrey Wright, Scarlett Johansson, Benedict Cumberbatch, Rupert Friend, Hope Davis.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"The story of a family and a family business. Starring: Benicio del Toro as Zsa-zsa Korda, one of the richest men in Europe.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong injury detail\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-05-23\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":101,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qRAnphZLAIg\",\"displayPriority\":5,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000186\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000187\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000698\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001084\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001275\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001395\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001400\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001409\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001410\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001411\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002527\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003325\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005645\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005698\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005699\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011116\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011117\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\",\"0000000003\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"eff6ffca-db00-4c6f-9e5e-1783c6ace2d7\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006097\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007517\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Universal Pictures\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006099\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"The Ballad of Wallis Island\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Eccentric lottery winner Charles dreams of getting his favorite musicians, McGwyer Mortimer, back together. The fantasy becomes real when the bandmates and former lovers agree to play a private show at his home on Wallis Island. Old tensions resurface as Charles tries desperately to salvage his dream gig.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Eccentric lottery winner Charles dreams of getting his favorite musicians, McGwyer Mortimer, back together. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000004\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"moderate bad language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-05-30\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":100,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=T9smxlnKNz0\",\"displayPriority\":5,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003501\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003970\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004380\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011120\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011121\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011122\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011123\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\",\"0000000003\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"4c563f44-cfa4-4914-86b1-b510771045c8\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006099\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007519\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Universal Pictures\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006197\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"The Piano Teacher Re-Release\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Academy Award–winning Austrian director Michael Haneke shifted his focus from the social to the psychological for this riveting study of female sexuality and the dynamics of control, an adaptation of a controversial 1983 novel by Elfriede Jelinek. Haneke finds his match in Isabelle Huppert, who delivers an icy but quietly seething performance as Erika, a middle-aged piano professor at a Viennese conservatory who lives with her mother, in a claustrophobically codependent relationship. Severely repressed, she satisfies her masochistic urges only voyeuristically until she meets Walter (Benoît Magimel), a young student whose desire for Erika leads to a destructive infatuation that upsets the careful equilibrium of her life. A critical breakthrough for Haneke, The Piano Teacher—which won the Grand Prix as well as dual acting awards for its stars at Cannes—is a formalist masterwork that remains a shocking sensation.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Academy Award–winning Austrian director Michael Haneke shifted his focus from the social to the psychological for this riveting study of female sexuality.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000005\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"Contains strong language, violence, sexual violence, sex and sado-masochism theme\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-06\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":131,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":6,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000258\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002207\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011332\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011333\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011334\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011380\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"051c196f-32eb-430c-b997-8401355bdef3\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006197\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007652\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Curzon\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006199\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Hidden (Caché)\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"A married couple is terrorized by a series of surveillance videotapes left on their front porch.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"A married couple is terrorized by a series of surveillance videotapes left on their front porch.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-20\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":118,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003240\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004195\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011332\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011334\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011380\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011394\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011412\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"8d52e414-ea56-449f-949a-6cbcfa55a8b7\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006199\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007654\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Curzon\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006203\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Tornado\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Set in the rugged landscape of 1790’s Britain, Tornado (played by model-songwriter Koki,) finds herself caught in a perilous situation when she and her father’s travelling puppet show crosses paths with a ruthless criminal gang led by Sugarman (PULP FICTION star Tim Roth) and his ambitious son Little Sugar (SLOW HORSES’ Jack Lowden). In an attempt to create a new life, Tornado seizes the opportunity to steal the gold from the gang’s most recent heist; what follows is a thrilling tale of adrenaline-fueled action as Tornado fights to escape a violent demise.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Set in the rugged landscape of 1790’s Britain, Tornado (played by model-songwriter Koki,) finds herself caught in a perilous situation.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong bloody violence, very strong language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-13\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":91,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":5,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003251\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003321\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010355\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011415\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011416\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011417\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000252\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000254\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000256\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\",\"0000000036\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"b32a6015-ac13-48b6-9e04-b64a47c5df98\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006203\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007659\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Lionsgate\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006204\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"28 Years Later\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Academy Award®-winning director Danny Boyle and Academy Award®-nominated writer Alex Garland reunite for 28 Years Later, a terrifying new story set in the world created by 28 Days Later. It’s been almost three decades since the rage virus escaped a biological weapons laboratory, and now, still in a ruthlessly enforced quarantine, some have found ways to exist amidst the infected. One such group of survivors lives on a small island connected to the mainland by a single, heavily-defended causeway. When one of the group leaves the island on a mission into the dark heart of the mainland, he discovers secrets, wonders, and horrors that have mutated not only the infected but other survivors as well.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"It’s been almost three decades since the rage virus escaped a biological weapons laboratory, and now, still in a ruthlessly enforced quarantine...\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-19\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":115,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=poEFz8Ivzug\",\"displayPriority\":1,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000313\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001100\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001270\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003206\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003678\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004531\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010558\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011257\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011418\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011419\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\",\"0000000030\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"a7823fd3-66f7-47af-87ba-d36ef45b168c\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006204\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007660\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Sony Pictures\"}],\"castAndCrew\":[{\"id\":\"0000000186\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Mathieu\",\"familyName\":\"Amalric\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000000187\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Riz\",\"familyName\":\"Ahmed\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000000698\",\"name\":{\"gi