 Zsa-zsa Korda, one of the richest men in Europe; Mia Threapleton as Liesl, his daughter/a nun; Michael Cera as Bjorn, their tutor. With: Riz Ahmed, Tom Hanks, Bryan Cranston, Mathieu Amalric, Richard Ayoade, Jeffrey Wright, Scarlett Johansson, Benedict Cumberbatch, Rupert Friend, Hope Davis.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"The story of a family and a family business. Starring: Benicio del Toro as Zsa-zsa Korda, one of the richest men in Europe.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong injury detail\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-05-23\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":101,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qRAnphZLAIg\",\"displayPriority\":5,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000186\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000187\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000698\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001084\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001275\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001395\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001400\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001409\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001410\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001411\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002527\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003325\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005645\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005698\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005699\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011116\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011117\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\",\"0000000003\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"eff6ffca-db00-4c6f-9e5e-1783c6ace2d7\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006097\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007517\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Universal Pictures\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006203\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Tornado\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Set in the rugged landscape of 1790’s Britain, Tornado (played by model-songwriter Koki,) finds herself caught in a perilous situation when she and her father’s travelling puppet show crosses paths with a ruthless criminal gang led by Sugarman (PULP FICTION star Tim Roth) and his ambitious son Little Sugar (SLOW HORSES’ Jack Lowden). In an attempt to create a new life, Tornado seizes the opportunity to steal the gold from the gang’s most recent heist; what follows is a thrilling tale of adrenaline-fueled action as Tornado fights to escape a violent demise.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Set in the rugged landscape of 1790’s Britain, Tornado (played by model-songwriter Koki,) finds herself caught in a perilous situation.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong bloody violence, very strong language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-13\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":91,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":5,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003251\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003321\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010355\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011415\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011416\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011417\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000252\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000254\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000256\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\",\"0000000036\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"b32a6015-ac13-48b6-9e04-b64a47c5df98\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006203\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007659\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Lionsgate\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006204\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"28 Years Later\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Academy Award®-winning director Danny Boyle and Academy Award®-nominated writer Alex Garland reunite for 28 Years Later, a terrifying new story set in the world created by 28 Days Later. It’s been almost three decades since the rage virus escaped a biological weapons laboratory, and now, still in a ruthlessly enforced quarantine, some have found ways to exist amidst the infected. One such group of survivors lives on a small island connected to the mainland by a single, heavily-defended causeway. When one of the group leaves the island on a mission into the dark heart of the mainland, he discovers secrets, wonders, and horrors that have mutated not only the infected but other survivors as well.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"It’s been almost three decades since the rage virus escaped a biological weapons laboratory, and now, still in a ruthlessly enforced quarantine...\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-19\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":115,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=poEFz8Ivzug\",\"displayPriority\":1,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000313\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001100\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001270\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003206\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003678\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004531\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010558\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011257\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011418\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011419\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\",\"0000000030\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"a7823fd3-66f7-47af-87ba-d36ef45b168c\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006204\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007660\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Sony Pictures\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006250\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Pavements: Alex Ross Perry and Stephen Malkmus Q&A\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"From Alex Ross Perry, the acclaimed director of Her Smell and Listen Up Philip and a distinctive voice in post-mumblecore cinema, comes an irreverent, genre-bending portrait of the iconic '90s indie rock band Pavement. Premiering at the 2024 Venice Film Festival, PAVEMENTS blends authentic archival footage, contemporary documentary moments, an ironic jukebox musical, a satirical Hollywood biopic, and playful mockumentary sequences, brilliantly collapsing the boundaries between reality and fiction.\\r\\n\\r\\nAs Pavement prepare for their sold-out 2022 reunion tour, the film captures surreal behind-the-scenes preparations for a musical adaptation of their songs, a museum dedicated entirely to the band's legacy, and a knowingly clichéd Hollywood biopic starring Joe Keery as frontman Stephen Malkmus.\\r\\n\\r\\nInterwoven with genuine archival footage and featuring the band members themselves alongside a cast of actors and comedians, PAVEMENTS humorously examines fan obsession, myth-making, and the cultural mechanics behind fame. This uniquely layered exploration challenges the traditional way stories about musicians are told with artistry, absurdity and humor, culminating in a refreshingly inventive and endearingly self-aware tribute to an unforgettable band. \\r\\n\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Alex Ross Perry's genre-bending portrait of legendary indie rock group Pavement.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"VS00000007\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-07-04\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":128,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001401\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011565\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011566\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011567\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011568\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011569\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011570\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011571\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011572\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000031\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":null,\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006250\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007712\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"MUBI\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006110\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"F1® The Movie\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Dubbed “the greatest that never was,” Sonny Hayes (Brad Pitt) was FORMULA 1’s most promising phenom of the 1990s until an accident on the track nearly ended his career. Thirty years later, he’s a nomadic racer-for-hire when he’s approached by his former teammate Ruben Cervantes (Javier Bardem), owner of a struggling FORMULA 1 team that is on the verge of collapse. Ruben convinces Sonny to come back to FORMULA 1 for one last shot at saving the team and being the best in the world. He’ll drive alongside Joshua Pearce (Damson Idris), the team's hotshot rookie intent on setting his own pace. But as the engines roar, Sonny’s past catches up with him and he finds that in FORMULA 1, your teammate is your fiercest competition—and the road to redemption is not something you can travel alone.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Dubbed “the greatest that never was,” Sonny Hayes (Brad Pitt) was FORMULA 1’s most promising phenom of the 1990s until an accident on the track nearly ended his career.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000004\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"infrequen